  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-catalog\" style=\"background: repeat rgb(255, 255, 255); color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px; padding: 20px;\">\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjLPGhDtlXv-5Kl8o7vjq1v9lMK6nnJ8cdpqzDP-r1Lav3mYTWhUlwHb1cBqHgBloynD5UKwdnZSfg6gkP-y-fWHPEaXUigrOFlrRY_XHs16XjfXjK4-OS2ubwcuhfgwhFqqD2VguSQwxJQxjvMt2GjSVkCEjmBEWcm2r596CA_ZvTvN7QS65MWy_3XGRdB\" style=\"box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px 10px 30px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n\n    <h2 style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\">BONG報第 383 期 • 目錄</h2>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; padding: 0px 10px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/2025.html\">封面作品</a></h3><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/e.html\">編輯室ê話</a></h3><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台語政策推動聯盟 專題</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">28</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/blog-post_41.html\">推動台語復振委員會、起造台語通行語法制</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\"><br /></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">31</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/blog-post_76.html\">洪子偉：廢除華語特權、恢復台語通行語地位</a></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">35</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/ai.html\">李勤岸：Ài放棄自我，成全母語教育</a></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">38</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/e_5.html\">分組論壇第一組 語言ê轉型正義</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">主講／洪子偉、林佳怡 &nbsp;記錄／李旺庭</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">做伙來唸詩</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">1</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/blog-post.html\">囡仔時</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳品臻</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">2</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/e_12.html\">鐘聲ê祝福</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 李淑貞</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">3</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/tir-lane-formosalansui-e.html\">Tīr lán妖嬌ê Formosa，唱lán上suí ê台灣歌</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ A kiat--ê（李俊德）</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">4</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/sui-e.html\">台灣上suí ê景緻——詩三首</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 黃明勝</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">阿瑞 --ā話仙</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">6</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/blog-post_12.html\">種佛手瓜</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 藍春瑞</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">是按怎án-ne生</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">8</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/an-ne-e.html\">求籤詩：電腦ê道理</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 洪明道</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台譯se̍h-se̍h唸</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">10</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/seh-seh-hootioh-ma-aihoo-e.html\">講hōo伊tio̍h，mā ài講hōo伊通，生活中ê台語實踐</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 吳孟儒</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台灣好食mi̍h</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">12</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/mih-ebeh.html\">田--裡ê芋仔beh收成</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳可芯</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">14</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/mih-emih.html\">上愛食ê三項mih仔</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 張寶明</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">16</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/mih.html\">甜粿黏跤</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 蔡秋芬</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台語sa攏有</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">18</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/sa-e.html\">台語新聞過音ê鹹酸苦澀</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">&nbsp;主講／邱丹霓 記錄／蘇錦蘭、陳亮穎</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">Lán來講看māi</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">20</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/lanmai-mih.html\">啥mi̍h是「講國語」</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 卉均</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">22</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/lanmai-e-ma-e-tang-siah-siah.html\">都市囡仔ê台語 mā ē-tàng siah-siah叫</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 廖啟助</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">24</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/02/lanmai.html\">辦語言活動，「語言意識」是第一要緊</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳育萱</div>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgA-a2S9Jytwe3gr2BEnC75GGZAQHIbIviCSelpBK2qQ3GPDj2rZRrgraVw7seocw2cELy2kyBmLV7oJNav6tLUgja-uoRMsyeaPfMBi3BjDDMoYOlBFHYwFmsvIQHD7SzXdNdmYuseYaqO0MuSm75CTTmdoRQvIfPRsmEvvTfcm8jEtESai8W8PbD2FH1K\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjOVK0otuRrTI4cRVgq_QXxummFMaPisDwlY_51_VfeuNzoENdhkOclOdGLKDq2U1eEFo7EPyf9JaHOlr1QsLAxh28Siqc2I9TO_NIiLt8Rmrnown4ywMA4ksrQ0TlMW8VAy3fquLqXpIL-9KlqPS05vfyAeARWWWdl00TQEG8C2tKLmUVmmGM0CDWhGI1J\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi20in9xKw5BPByKODlpT40QttBQBpGqfKWj9_sAQh9oLVfy-jRtdc_JH09t9MiB8fLolDJbfO4s2GGYZWYNpktdrEIh2nLycKd6wydIsY1gBBDL2gvXNMPD1AgiKXOSNieKNCQ4hplEOAPuXI6e1m2dNMlVF_hNo54FUehi5sDslJppypqW0Up8oJJqfkx\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 383期，2026年02月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
